SmartSessionERC7739::sizeExtremes
├── given a correctly bound envelope
│   ├── when the description is 65535 bytes
│   │   └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
│   ├── when encodeData is 65535 words
│   │   └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
│   └── when both are at their maxima
│       └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
├── given both at their maxima
│   └── when a word changes after the hash was bound
│       └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
├── given a trailer claiming both maxima over a short tail
│   └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
├── given an enabled 65535-byte description with no closing parenthesis
│   └── it never reverts and returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
└── given fuzzed inputs
    ├── when the trailer is any uint16 pair over a bounded tail
    │   └── it never reverts and returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE or INVALID_SIGNATURE
    └── when the description is within 1024 bytes of the maximum
        └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
